    "diagnosis": "Adamantinomatous craniopharyngioma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "This child&rsquo;s tumour shows wet keratin that is just beginning to undergo dystrophic mineralization, as well as metaplastic ossification in stroma underlying the epithelium.",
